    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the abandoned planet Zombotron. This planet was once colonized by people, but after some time people abandoned and forgot about it for unknown reasons.<br><br>The main character Blaze Rush is a freelance mercenary. One day, while drifting through space in his spaceship in search of a new order, Blaze received a distress call from a mysterious planet not marked on his galactic maps and went to help. But the rescue operation failed. And now the hero will not only have to survive himself and help those in need, but also solve the mystery of the planet Zombotron.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892580/extras/1c5bebb3544192cc79a7a809b1347895.poster.avif?t=1723883111\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892580/extras/1c5bebb3544192cc79a7a809b1347895.webm?t=1723883111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892580/extras/1c5bebb3544192cc79a7a809b1347895.mp4?t=1723883111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In this action platformer you will have to fight countless different enemies: zombies, robots and other mysterious monsters. Find weapons and upgrade your skills to find and rescue survivors, and explore this mysterious planet together.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br>\u2014 Well-developed destructible physical world;<br>\u2014 Lots of different weapons;<br>\u2014 You can destroy enemies using the environment;<br>\u2014 Various enemies with unique abilities;<br>\u2014 Use the gamepad and headphones for best experience.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892580/extras/b251904494893de24b29e3199e3ddf0e.poster.avif?t=1723883111\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892580/extras/b251904494893de24b29e3199e3ddf0e.webm?t=1723883111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892580/extras/b251904494893de24b29e3199e3ddf0e.mp4?t=1723883111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Zombotron Re-Boot is a remaster of the original Zombotron Flash game series, with updated graphics, an improved physics engine and new, incredibly rich effects!",
